          <div class="h4">Building Future-Ready Institutions for Viksit Bihar, Viksit Bharat @@2047 with OD Excellence and Sewa Bhaav</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-10 text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-aos-duration="500">
          <p>The Organization Development operates on the foundation of the Four OD Pillars: Facility Certification, FRU Strengthening, Governance & Convergence, Outreach, and the creation of Knowledge Products. We endeavor to establish a unified system where institutional culture is aligned with purpose-driven efficiency, accountability, and citizen-centric values.</p>
          <p>By embedding the 5 Cs — Communication, Critical Thinking, Creativity, Collaboration, and Cultural Competence — we seek to nurture a transformative ecosystem, strengthening organizations that resonate with the vision of Viksit Bihar for Viksit Bharat @@2047.</p>
          <p>Our Theory of Change rests on the belief that systemic transformation is achievable when purpose, vision, and performance are aligned through a culture rooted in Sewa Bhaav, evidence-based interventions, and collaborative governance. We provide techno-managerial, structural, and strategic support to public health government institutions in Bihar. It is dedicated to transforming healthcare institutions into future-ready centers of excellence.</p>
          <p>Additionally, we collaborate with government bodies, development partners, and local stakeholders to streamline governance structures, enhance patient-centric care and institutional accountability, and embed a culture of Sewa Bhaav with goal-driven efficiency.</p>
